er]] [[sits|sit]] [[in]] [[its]] [[web]], [[right]] [[next to]] Nhung's [[face]]. [[She]] [[jumps|jump]] [[back]] [[and]] [[falls|fall]] [[into]] [[the]] [[wet]] [[rice]] [[field]]. [[Ten]] [[small]] [[frogs|frog]] [[jump]] [[away]] [[from]] [[her]]. Grandpa [[does|do]] [[not]] [[laugh]]. [[Well]], [[he]] [[laughs|laugh]] [[a]] [[little]].`,`vn`:`C\u00f4n tr\u00f9ng \u1edf kh\u1eafp n\u01a1i. M\u1ed9t con nh\u1ec7n to \u0111ang ng\u1ed3i tr\u00ean m\u1ea1ng nh\u1ec7n, ngay s\u00e1t m\u1eb7t Nhung. C\u00f4 b\u00e9 nh\u1ea3y l\u00f9i l\u1ea1i, r\u01a1i t\u00f5m xu\u1ed1ng ru\u1ed9ng n\u01b0\u1edbc. M\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u00fa \u1ebfch nh\u1ecf nh\u1ea3y t\u00e1n lo\u1ea1n. \u00d4ng kh\u00f4ng c\u01b0\u1eddi. \u00c0, th\u1eadt ra \u00f4ng c\u00f3 c\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat.`},{`en`:`Grandpa [[puts|put]] [[his]] [[hand]] [[in]] [[the]] [[earth]]. \`[[Good]] [[earth]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[Nature]] [[gives|give]] [[us]] [[everything]]: [[rice]], [[fruit]], [[wood]] [[for]] [[the]] [[fire]].\` [[Every]] [[day]], Nhung [[learns|learn]] [[something]] [[new]] [[about]] [[the]] [[farm]]. [[She]] [[is|be]] [[not]] [[so]] [[afraid]] [[of]] [[insects|insect]] [[now]].`,`vn`:`\u00d4ng th\u1ecdc tay v\u00e0o \u0111\u1ea5t. \`\u0110\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i. \`Thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean cho ta m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9: g\u1ea1o, hoa qu\u1ea3, c\u1ee7i \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111un.\` Ng\u00e0y n\u00e0o Nhung c\u0169ng h\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec1u g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 m\u1edbi m\u1ebb v\u1ec1 trang tr\u1ea1i. Gi\u1edd c\u00f4 b\u00e9 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n s\u1ee3 c\u00f4n tr\u00f9ng l\u1eafm n\u1eefa.`},{`en`:`[[In]] [[the]] [[afternoon]], [[she]] [[goes|go]] [[to]] [[the]] [[lake]] [[with]] Muc. Muc [[jumps|jump]] [[in]] [[and]] [[swims|swim]] [[after]] [[the]] [[fish]], [[but]] [[he]] [[never]] [[catches|catch]] [[one]]. [[In]] [[the]] [[evening]] [[sun]], [[the]] [[rice]] [[field]] [[is|be]] [[gold]].`,`vn`:`Bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u, c\u00f4 b\u00e9 ra h\u1ed3 c\u00f9ng M\u1ef1c. M\u1ef1c nh\u1ea3y \u00f9m xu\u1ed1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc, b\u01a1i theo \u0111\u00e0n c\u00e1, nh\u01b0ng ch\u1eb3ng bao gi\u1edd b\u1eaft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c con n\u00e0o. Trong n\u1eafng chi\u1ec1u, c\u00e1nh \u0111\u1ed3ng l\u00faa v\u00e0ng \u00f3ng.`},{`en`:`\`[[In]] [[the]] [[city]], [[I]] can't [[have]] [[a]] [[pet]],\` Nhung [[tells|tell]] Grandpa. \`[[Now]] Muc [[is|be]] [[my]] [[pet]].\` \`Muc [[is|be]] [[not]] [[a]] [[pet]],\` [[says|say]] Grandpa. \`[[He]] [[is|be]] [[the]] [[boss]] [[of]] [[this]] [[farm]].\``,`vn`:`\`\u1ede th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1, ch\u00e1u kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nu\u00f4i th\u00fa c\u01b0ng,\` Nhung n\u00f3i v\u1edbi \u00f4ng. \`Gi\u1edd M\u1ef1c l\u00e0 th\u00fa c\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a ch\u00e1u.\` \`M\u1ef1c \u0111\u00e2u ph\u1ea3i th\u00fa c\u01b0ng,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i. \`N\u00f3 l\u00e0 \u00f4ng ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a c\u1ea3 trang tr\u1ea1i n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea5y.\``},{`en`:`[[At]] [[night]], Nhung [[looks|look]] [[at]] [[the]] [[stars|star]] [[and]] [[thinks|think]] [[of]] [[home]]. [[She]] [[remembers|remember]] [[a]] [[small]] [[light]] [[in]] an [[upstairs]] [[window]] [[of]] [[the]] [[house]] [[with]] [[the]] [[blue]] [[door]].`,`vn`:`\u0110\u00eam \u0111\u1ebfn, Nhung ng\u1eafm sao v\u00e0 ngh\u0129 v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0. C\u00f4 b\u00e9 nh\u1edb t\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u00e1nh \u0111\u00e8n nh\u1ecf \u1edf c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 t\u1ea7ng tr\u00ean c\u1ee7a ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 c\u1eeda xanh.`},{`en`:`[[Then]] [[one]] [[evening]], Muc [[does|do]] [[not]] [[come]] [[home]] [[for]] [[dinner]]. Muc [[is|be]] [[never]] [[late]] [[for]] [[dinner]].`,`vn`:`R\u1ed3i m\u1ed9t bu\u1ed5i t\u1ed1i, M\u1ef1c kh\u00f4ng v\u1ec1 \u0103n c\u01a1m. M\u00e0 M\u1ef1c th\u00ec ch\u01b0a bao gi\u1edd v\u1ec1 mu\u1ed9n b\u1eefa c\u01a1m c\u1ea3.`}],`tease`:`M\u1ef1c \u0111i \u0111\u00e2u r\u1ed3i?`}]}